  "arrangerNotes": "Melody (soprano) of Bach's chorale setting, verified against the LilyPond score on English Wikipedia; its repeated phrases are written out. Words as in the score (macaronic Latin/German; the English 'Good Christian men, rejoice' text fits the same notes). Slurred notes carry one syllable over several notes. No simplification needed. Range low 6 to 6. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
